  "title": "SB 1666 (107th General Assembly): As enacted, provides for issuance of photo identification license free of charge to person who signs an affidavit stating the person: does not have a valid government issued photo identification; is a registered voter in this state; and needs the photo identification license for voting purposes. - Amends TCA Title 55.",
